   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numbers and price questions",
     "texto": [
      "To ask how much something costs, use «Hoeveel kost dit?» (singular) or «Hoeveel kosten deze?» (plural, with «kosten»). The tens are regular: twintig (20), dertig (30), veertig (40), vijftig (50) and honderd (100). Notice that the currency «euro» stays in the singular after numbers, unlike English, where you say «twelve euros»: «twaalf euro», «twintig euro»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
